      "start_seconds": 1.21,
      "end_seconds": 6.97,
      "duration_seconds": 5.76,
      "text": "Hello doctor, sorry, I took a wrong turn on the way here."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.0,
      "end_seconds": 14.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.17,
      "text": "Okay, you're alright, take a seat. What can I do for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 14.68,
      "end_seconds": 29.35,
      "duration_seconds": 14.67,
      "text": "mainly bloating when I slip up there's a couple of other things but that's the main one i wasn't sure whether to come in at all to be honest"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.51,
      "end_seconds": 34.06,
      "duration_seconds": 3.55,
      "text": "what do you take on a normal day?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 35.19,
      "end_seconds": 47.02,
      "duration_seconds": 11.83,
      "text": "Losartan, 50 milligrams, once a day for my blood pressure. Sorry, what was I saying, it's clopidogrel, 75 milligrams, once a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.99,
      "end_seconds": 67.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.97,
      "text": "Has this been going on for long?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 69.07,
      "end_seconds": 73.68,
      "duration_seconds": 4.61,
      "text": "Around two weeks... no wait it's more like one week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 73.95,
      "end_seconds": 77.22,
      "duration_seconds": 3.27,
      "text": "yes carry on. Does anything help it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.89,
      "end_seconds": 82.64,
      "duration_seconds": 4.75,
      "text": "um, only avoiding gluten, and it's not much"
